{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And there I will meet with you.</b> For the Holy One, blessed be He, has in His world only four cubits of halakhah (Berakhot 8), and in a place where peace is found — for there they do not study in order to provoke. And from there the voice would enter the Tent of Meeting, as Rashi explained (Numbers 7:89). For the Ark carries all the consecrated vessels, and through it the divine inflow descends upon all of them. And we already find (Sotah 35a) that the Ark carried its bearers, and this is a kind of allusion to those who support the students of Torah: they appear to be carrying, but they are carried by the students of Torah."], :book :exodus, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:23:04.038900279Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}